WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
As long as you don't choose hospital or prison, I agree.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:04,440
There's something you must know first

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,640
I'm not a healer

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,840
To be precise, I am lost

5
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,640
It's not too late to change your decision now

6
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,440
Big brother saved my mother and me

7
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,160
Big brother is so disappointed

8
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,840
You saved my life

9
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,400
As long as you are willing to take us in

10
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,000
Xiaoxuan and I will go with you

11
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,750
My neighbor Suki's brother

12
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:22,350
Is the manager of Oligar Hotel

13
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:40,660
He may know the current situation of the hotel, Sister Zhang

14
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,620
Can you really clean up the damage in the hotel?
